{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297921","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297921","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029792101:1":{"text":"이번엔 신기한 물건들을 좀 들여왔지. 마음에 드는 게 있을지도 모르겠는데?","source_cn":"这次带了不少小玩意儿来，看看有没有你喜欢的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0F7EBD5019B019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792102:1":{"text":"어, 이건 땅거미 숲의 꽃장식이네요?","source_cn":"咦，这是薄暮丛林的花饰？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220B8E6B02C13D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792103:1":{"text":"귀여워요! 울머스도 좋아하실 거예요.","source_cn":"真可爱，奥曼斯一定会很喜欢的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C503938B75669A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792104:1":{"text":"헤헤, 그렇게 마음에 들면 예전에 말했던 거, 조금 더 이야기해봐도 되지 않을까? ","source_cn":"嘿嘿，既然你喜欢，那前头说过的事是不是可以谈谈了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1DB9006ED78DA97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792105:1":{"text":"이 섬에 관광객들을 데려와서 탐험까지 시켜보자는 일이요?","source_cn":"你是说，带一些游客来岛上观光——甚至探险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805793C52026331B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792106:1":{"text":"어차피 네 땅이니까 네 맘대로 해도 되는 거잖아.","source_cn":"毕竟是你的地盘嘛，你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5B8C60B975031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792107:1":{"text":"정말요? 그럼 마음껏 모든 사람들에게 엄청난 꿈을 선사해도 되는 건가요?","source_cn":"真的吗——那我可要为所欲为地让所有人享受很了不起的美梦了哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8793CAA472104353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792108:1":{"text":"어, 그, 그건...","source_cn":"咦，这、这个可——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273AD7C3E7EF2C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792109:1":{"text":"후후후, 농담이에요. 마음씨 착한 사람이라면 언제든지 환영이죠.","source_cn":"呵呵呵，开玩笑的，只要是心地纯洁的人，我随时欢迎哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051715FD3263EA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029792110:1":{"text":"윽... 관광객의 인성까지 따져야 한다니, 그건 좀 무리일 것 같은데.","source_cn":"呃……还要考察游客的道德素养吗……那感觉还是算了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CECC320F3E0592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"타시","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}